    "description": "Objective\n\nRecord ownership should follow the Brand Ambassador so sharing and \"my records\" views work correctly.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Set Sign-Up Owner to the associated Brand Ambassador when the BA field is first populated\n\n* Re-set Owner whenever the BA field changes\n\n* Fallback owner when BA is blank = a Jumpr Solutions user\n\n* Fallback user stored in a CUSTOM SETTING so an admin can change it later without editing automation\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Owner tracks BA on create and on every BA change\n\n* Blank BA assigns the configured fallback user\n\n* Fallback user is changeable without a deployment\n\nDependencies\n\nBLOCKS BUILD-37 (owner-based list views). Interacts with BUILD-01 (sharing model) — the sharing design must account for the fallback Jumpr user holding records.\n\nEstimate: M · \\~6h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 16.",
